  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"color:#24292e;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &#x27;Apple Color Emoji&#x27;, &#x27;Segoe UI Emoji&#x27;;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:#ffffff\">歡迎來到 SlashBladeCraftTweaker 維基！</p>\n<p style=\"color:#24292e;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &#x27;Apple Color Emoji&#x27;, &#x27;Segoe UI Emoji&#x27;;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:#ffffff\">這是為自訂 SlashBlade 設計的 CraftTweaker 擴充套件，<span style=\"color:#24292e;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &#x27;Apple Color Emoji&#x27;, &#x27;Segoe UI Emoji&#x27;;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:#ffffff;display:inline !important;float:none\">可註冊您自訂的 SlashBlade ItemStack 與 AwakeBladeRecipe（進行中），並能取得其他刀劍（進行中）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"color:#24292e;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &#x27;Apple Color Emoji&#x27;, &#x27;Segoe UI Emoji&#x27;;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"color:#24292e;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &#x27;Segoe UI&#x27;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &#x27;Apple Color Emoji&#x27;, &#x27;Segoe UI Emoji&#x27;;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;background-color:#ffffff;display:inline !important;float:none\"><span style=\"display:inline !important;float:none;background-color:#ffffff;color:#19171c;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:600;line-height:inherit;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none\">重要注意事項：</span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>仍在開發中，<span style=\"font-family:arial black,sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"text-align:left;color:#f00;text-transform:none;line-height:inherit;text-indent:0px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;text-decoration:underline;display:inline !important;float:none;background-color:#ffffff\">請自行承擔使用風險。</span></strong></span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要 Forge <span style=\"background-color:#ffffff\">1.12.2 - 14.23.5.2768</span>。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"display:inline !important;float:none;background-color:#ffffff;color:#19171c;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:1.5;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none\">歡迎加入 MMF Group 的 Discord：</span><a style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#6441a4;font-family:inherit;font-style:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;text-align:left;text-decoration:none;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;border:0px solid #a49fad\" href=\"https://discord.gg/qWebbVh\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/qWebbVh</a></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
